{"type":"assistant","message":{"model":"claude-opus-4-6","id":"msg_01PCh5zYyMJfcu9kKzo1UPh4","type":"message","role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"thinking","thinking":"The user wants me to generate detailed predicted experimental data for each planned experiment in the experiment_plan, assuming the \"best\" tier outcome. I need to provide rationale for each prediction based on the best tier definition.\n\nLet me carefully go through each planned experiment and generate realistic predicted results with rationale.\n\nKey best-tier parameters:\n- G3_deploy_ratio_smolvla: [0.82, 0.92]\n- G3_deploy_ratio_openvla: [0.85, 0.98]\n- G3_deploy_ratio_libero_avg: [0.85, 0.95]\n- success_rate_delta_pp: [0, 8]\n\n\n- bound_tightness_ratio_eps001: [1.0, 3.0]\n- eps001_preservation_rate: [0.9, 0.95]\n- cross_model_margin_ratio: [40, 93]\n- pruned_token_attn_weight_ratio: [0.1, 0.4]\n\nI'm also pulling in the baseline metrics from the MVP to anchor my predictions: the margin ratio of 93.23, deployment ratio of 0.8679, and the action loss values showing that the pruning approach achieved a 12.9% reduction compared to baseline.","signature":""}],"stop_reason":null,"stop_sequence":null,"stop_details":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":2,"cache_creation_input_tokens":12510,"cache_read_input_tokens":11841,"cache_creation":{"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0,"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":12510},"output_tokens":21,"service_tier":"standard","inference_geo":"not_available"},"diagnostics":null,"context_management":null},"parent_tool_use_id":null,"session_id":"69face55-f680-40e2-aea1-97304e995fd8","uuid":"6dc4f8da-5703-44e0-81bf-4560fc462d77"}
{"type":"assistant","message":{"model":"claude-opus-4-6","id":"msg_01PCh5zYyMJfcu9kKzo1UPh4","type":"message","role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"text","text":"```yaml\ntier: best\nnarrative_guidance: >\n  原始 framing 完全成立——IMM 提供首个 certified robustness + lossless compression for VLA，\n  三条 claim 均有跨模型跨 benchmark 支撑。Denoising claim 从 empirical observation 升级为\n  mechanistic finding（pruned token attention weight 显著低，gradient contribution 近零）。\n  Paper lead with 'provably robust AND performance-enhancing compression'。CoRL 投稿无需降低任何 claim 强度。\n  Formal bound tightness ratio < 3x 使 certified robustness 不仅是理论装饰而是实用部署判据。\n  Cross-model (SmolVLA + OpenVLA) × cross-benchmark (aloha_sim_insertion + LIBERO) 的 2×2 矩阵\n  让审稿人无法以 'single data point' 驳回。\n\nimagined_experiments:\n  - name: \"Success Rate Evaluation (aloha_sim_insertion)\"\n    plan_id: \"plan_001\"\n    description: >\n      aloha_sim_insertion 上 baseline vs v8b+prune(50%) vs v8b bypass，50+ episodes rollout\n      对比 success rate，验证 action loss 改善是否反映在任务表现上。\n    expected_results:\n      baseline_success_rate: 0.82\n      v8b_prune50_success_rate: 0.88\n      v8b_bypass_success_rate: 0.56\n      random_prune50_success_rate: 0.60\n      episodes_per_condition: 60\n      success_rate_delta_pp: 6\n      p_value_prune_vs_baseline: 0.031\n    result_rationale: >\n      MVP 已确认 acis_prune50 action loss (0.003538) 低于 baseline (0.004063)，G3_deploy=0.8679。\n      Action loss 与 success rate 的单调关系在 aloha_sim_insertion 这类 low-dimensional insertion task 上\n      高度可靠——loss 降低 ~13% 对应 success rate 提升 ~6pp。Baseline 82% 是 SmolVLA 在此 task 的\n      典型水平（256-token full context）。Pruning 后 88% 的提升来自 denoising effect：ACIS 移除的\n      token 携带视觉噪声（背景、桌面纹理），减少了 action head 的分心。Bypass（不经 ACIS 直接送全 token）\n      的 56% 反映 ACIS training 对 backbone representation 的微弱扰动——backbone 在 stage1 被冻结\n      但 stage2 LoRA 适配了 ACIS-pruned 的 token 分布，全 token 输入时分布 mismatch。\n      Random prune 60% 因为随机删除了 ~50% task-relevant token，action prediction 严重退化。\n    tables:\n      - name: \"Table 1: Success Rate Comparison (aloha_sim_insertion, 60 episodes)\"\n        columns: [\"Method\", \"Action Loss\", \"Success Rate (%)\", \"95% CI\"]\n        rows:\n          - [\"Baseline (no compression)\", 0.00406, 82, \"71-90\"]\n          - [\"IMM prune 50%\", 0.00354, 88, \"78-94\"]\n          - [\"IMM bypass (no prune)\", 0.01865, 56, \"43-68\"]\n          - [\"Random prune 50%\", 0.01797, 60, \"47-72\"]\n    figures_description:\n      - \"Bar chart: 4 条件的 success rate with 95% CI error bars，IMM prune 50% 显著高于 baseline\"\n    analysis: >\n      Success rate 与 action loss 方向一致，确认 G3<1.0 不是 evaluation artifact。\n      IMM+prune 在 lossless 的基础上实际提升了 task performance (+6pp)。\n      这是 Claim 2 (lossless compression) 最强的 evidence。\n\n  - name: \"LIBERO Benchmark Validation (SmolVLA)\"\n    plan_id: \"plan_002\"\n    description: >\n      SmolVLA+IMM two-stage 在 LIBERO-Object (10 tasks) / LIBERO-Spatial (10 tasks) /\n      LIBERO-Goal (10 tasks) 上训练+评估，对比 baseline。每 task 20 episodes。\n    expected_results:\n      libero_object_baseline_sr: 0.78\n      libero_object_imm_prune50_sr: 0.83\n      libero_spatial_baseline_sr: 0.71\n      libero_spatial_imm_prune50_sr: 0.76\n      libero_goal_baseline_sr: 0.65\n      libero_goal_imm_prune50_sr: 0.69\n      libero_avg_baseline_sr: 0.713\n      libero_avg_imm_prune50_sr: 0.76\n      G3_deploy_ratio_libero_object: 0.88\n      G3_deploy_ratio_libero_spatial: 0.90\n      G3_deploy_ratio_libero_goal: 0.92\n      G3_deploy_ratio_libero_avg: 0.90\n      G1_margin_ratio_libero: 78.5\n      eps001_preservation_libero: 0.91\n    result_rationale: >\n      LIBERO 比 aloha_sim_insertion 更复杂（多物体交互、空间推理、长 horizon goal），\n      SmolVLA 的 baseline 水平更低。IMM 的 denoising effect 在更复杂场景中仍然存在但\n      幅度稍减——复杂 task 中更多 token 是 task-relevant 的（多物体 → 更多有用视觉信息），\n      因此 pruning 50% 时误删有用 token 的概率稍高。G3_deploy_ratio 从 aloha 的 0.87 上升到\n      LIBERO 平均 0.90，仍然 <1.0 说明 denoising effect 跨 benchmark 成立。\n      LIBERO-Goal 最难（需要理解语言指定的 goal state），G3 最接近 1.0 但仍在范围内。\n      Margin ratio 从 93x 降到 78.5x 因为 LIBERO 的 token importance 分布更 uniform\n      （更多 token 竞争 top-k），但仍远超 baseline，G1 稳过。\n      Preservation rate 0.91 略低于 aloha 的 0.92，在 best-tier 范围内。\n    tables:\n      - name: \"Table 2: LIBERO Suite Results (SmolVLA, 20 eps/task)\"\n        columns: [\"Suite\", \"Baseline SR%\", \"IMM Prune50 SR%\", \"Δpp\", \"G3 Ratio\", \"G1 Margin\"]\n        rows:\n          - [\"LIBERO-Object\", 78, 83, \"+5\", 0.88, \"82.1x\"]\n          - [\"LIBERO-Spatial\", 71, 76, \"+5\", 0.90, \"76.3x\"]\n          - [\"LIBERO-Goal\", 65, 69, \"+4\", 0.92, \"72.8x\"]\n          - [\"LIBERO-Avg\", 71.3, 76.0, \"+4.7\", 0.90, \"78.5x\"]\n    figures_description:\n      - \"Grouped bar chart: 3 suites × 2 conditions (baseline vs IMM prune)，每 bar 显示 per-task SR 的 std error\"\n      - \"Radar plot: 10 LIBERO-Object tasks 的 per-task success rate，baseline vs IMM 两条线\"\n    analysis: >\n      跨 benchmark 泛化成功。LIBERO 三个 suite 全部展示 G3<1.0 且 success rate ≥ baseline。\n      更复杂 task 的 denoising 幅度递减但 compression 始终 lossless。这直接回应 RC2。\n\n  - name: \"OpenVLA Cross-Model Validation (LIBERO)\"\n    plan_id: \"plan_003\"\n    description: >\n      IMM two-stage 在 OpenVLA (7B) 上复现，LIBERO-Object/Spatial/Goal 评估。\n      验证 two-stage training 的模型无关性。\n    expected_results:\n      openvla_libero_object_baseline_sr: 0.82\n      openvla_libero_object_imm_prune50_sr: 0.86\n      openvla_libero_spatial_baseline_sr: 0.76\n      openvla_libero_spatial_imm_prune50_sr: 0.80\n      openvla_libero_goal_baseline_sr: 0.70\n      openvla_libero_goal_imm_prune50_sr: 0.73\n      openvla_libero_avg_G3_deploy_ratio: 0.92\n      openvla_G1_margin_ratio: 62.4\n      openvla_eps001_preservation: 0.91\n      openvla_acis_prune_vs_random_ratio: 4.2\n    result_rationale: >\n      OpenVLA 7B 的 baseline 在 LIBERO 上强于 SmolVLA（更大模型 → 更好的视觉理解），\n      因此 headroom 更小，denoising 的绝对增益（Δpp）稍低。G3 ratio 0.92 仍 <1.0\n      但接近上界——7B 模型已经有较强的 internal denoising 能力（larger model = better\n      implicit regularization），ACIS 的额外 denoising 贡献边际递减。\n      G1 margin ratio 降至 62.4x（仍在 best-tier [40, 93] 内）因为 OpenVLA 的\n      attention 分布更 sharp（7B 模型的 attention 更 concentrated），baseline margin\n      本身就稍高，IMM 的相对提升比稍小。Preservation rate 0.91 与 SmolVLA 一致，\n      说明 margin-based stability 与模型规模无关，纯粹取决于 ACIS 训练质量。\n      Cross-model margin ratio = 62.4/93.23 × 100 = 67%，在 best-tier [40, 93] 内。\n    tables:\n      - name: \"Table 3: OpenVLA (7B) LIBERO Results\"\n        columns: [\"Suite\", \"Baseline SR%\", \"IMM Prune50 SR%\", \"Δpp\", \"G3 Ratio\"]\n        rows:\n          - [\"LIBERO-Object\", 82, 86, \"+4\", 0.89]\n          - [\"LIBERO-Spatial\", 76, 80, \"+4\", 0.91]\n          - [\"LIBERO-Goal\", 70, 73, \"+3\", 0.95]\n          - [\"LIBERO-Avg\", 76.0, 79.7, \"+3.7\", 0.92]\n      - name: \"Table 4: Cross-Model Summary\"\n        columns: [\"Metric\", \"SmolVLA\", \"OpenVLA\", \"Ratio\"]\n        rows:\n          - [\"G1 Margin Ratio\", \"93.2x\", \"62.4x\", \"67%\"]\n          - [\"G3 Deploy (LIBERO avg)\", 0.90, 0.92, \"—\"]\n          - [\"eps001 Preservation\", 0.92, 0.91, \"99%\"]\n          - [\"ACIS vs Random Prune\", \"5.1x\", \"4.2x\", \"82%\"]\n    figures_description:\n      - \"2×3 grouped bar chart: 2 models × 3 LIBERO suites，同时显示 baseline 和 IMM prune50 SR\"\n    analysis: >\n      Two-stage IMM 在 7B 模型上成功复现，G3<1.0 跨模型成立。\n      Margin ratio 随模型规模递减但仍远超 baseline（62x），\n      证明 IMM 不是 small-model-specific trick。2 models × 3 benchmarks = 6 个数据点\n      全部 G3<1.0，denoising claim 不可归因于单一设置的 artifact。\n\n  - name: \"Training Ablation (Joint vs Grad-Isolated vs Two-Stage)\"\n    plan_id: \"plan_004\"\n    description: >\n      joint (v7 style) vs gradient-isolated (v8 style) vs two-stage (v8b style)\n      三路对比，统一超参数（lr, epochs, batch size），aloha_sim_insertion。\n    expected_results:\n      joint_clean_action_loss: 0.0134\n      joint_G3_deploy_ratio: 3.19\n      joint_G1_margin_ratio: 57.3\n      joint_bypass_loss: 0.0078\n      grad_isolated_clean_action_loss: 0.00546\n      grad_isolated_G3_deploy_ratio: 1.34\n      grad_isolated_G1_margin_ratio: 50.2\n      grad_isolated_bypass_loss: 0.0290\n      two_stage_clean_action_loss: 0.00354\n      two_stage_G3_deploy_ratio: 0.87\n      two_stage_G1_margin_ratio: 93.2\n      two_stage_bypass_loss: 0.0187\n    result_rationale: >\n      三路对比清晰展示 co-adaptation 的梯度路径效应：\n      (1) Joint training (v7)：ACIS 和 backbone 同时优化，backbone 学会依赖 ACIS 的 gating 信号，\n      导致 bypass 时 backbone 自身的 action prediction 被损坏（bypass loss 0.0078 很低说明\n      backbone 已 co-adapt 到 ACIS 存在的条件下工作，但 standard path 带 ACIS 时 loss 反而\n      高达 0.0134 因为 ACIS 的 importance scoring 和 backbone 的 feature extraction 互相干扰）。\n      G3=3.19 说明 compression 严重有损。\n      (2) Gradient-isolated (v8)：stop_gradient 阻断了 ACIS → backbone 的梯度，但 backbone\n      仍在 ACIS prune 后的 token 分布上训练，产生 implicit co-adaptation。G3=1.34 改善很大\n      但仍 >1.0——backbone 适应了 pruned distribution 但没有充分保留 full-context 能力。\n      (3) Two-stage (v8b)：Stage1 冻结 backbone 独立训 ACIS → ACIS 学到 backbone 原始 feature 的\n      importance 排序；Stage2 冻结 ACIS 用 LoRA 微调 backbone → backbone 适配 pruned token\n      但 LoRA 的 low-rank 约束防止过度偏离。G3=0.87 < 1.0 因为 pruning 的 denoising effect\n      在 backbone 不被 co-adapt 破坏时得以完整发挥。\n      Margin ratio 的差异反映了 ACIS scoring function 的质量：two-stage 的 ACIS 在 frozen backbone\n      feature 上训练，importance 排序更稳定。\n    tables:\n      - name: \"Table 5: Training Strategy Ablation (aloha_sim_insertion)\"\n        columns: [\"Strategy\", \"Action Loss\", \"G3 Ratio\", \"G1 Margin\", \"Bypass Loss\", \"Backbone Damage?\"]\n        rows:\n          - [\"Joint (v7)\", 0.0134, 3.19, \"57.3x\", 0.0078, \"Severe\"]\n          - [\"Grad-Isolated (v8)\", 0.00546, 1.34, \"50.2x\", 0.0290, \"Moderate\"]\n          - [\"Two-Stage (v8b)\", 0.00354, 0.87, \"93.2x\", 0.0187, \"None\"]\n          - [\"Baseline (no ACIS)\", 0.00406, \"—\", \"1.0x\", \"—\", \"N/A\"]\n    figures_description:\n      - \"Training loss 曲线: 3 strategies × 2 metrics (standard loss + bypass loss) over training steps\"\n      - \"Bar chart: G3 ratio 对比，水平虚线标注 1.0 阈值，only two-stage 在线下\"\n    analysis: >\n      Two-stage 是唯一实现 G3<1.0 的策略。Co-adaptation 的严重性随解耦程度单调递减。\n      这为 Claim 2 提供了 mechanistic ablation support——不是 ACIS 本身 magic，而是训练策略决定了\n      backbone 是否保持 denoising-compatible representation。\n\n  - name: \"Formal Bound Empirical Verification\"\n    plan_id: \"plan_005\"\n    description: >\n      多 ε 水平 (0.005, 0.01, 0.02, 0.05, 0.1) 下测量 top-k stability，\n      绘制 theoretical bound vs empirical violation rate 对比图。\n      需要估计 Lipschitz constant L（spectral norm method）。\n    expected_results:\n      lipschitz_L_spectral: 1.07\n      lipschitz_L_empirical: 0.14\n      delta_k_median: 0.934\n      eps_005_theoretical_bound: 0.0287\n      eps_005_empirical_violation: 0.018\n      eps_005_tightness_ratio: 1.59\n      eps_001_theoretical_bound: 0.00574\n      eps_001_empirical_violation: 0.0038\n      eps_001_tightness_ratio: 1.51\n      eps_002_theoretical_bound: 0.01148\n      eps_002_empirical_violation: 0.0065\n      eps_002_tightness_ratio: 1.77\n      eps_005_theoretical_bound_v2: 0.02871\n      eps_005_empirical_violation_v2: 0.018\n      eps_005_tightness_ratio_v2: 1.59\n      eps_01_theoretical_bound: 0.05742\n      eps_01_empirical_violation: 0.072\n      eps_01_tightness_ratio: 1.25\n      eps_02_theoretical_bound: 0.11484\n      eps_02_empirical_violation: 0.165\n      eps_02_tightness_ratio: 1.44\n      bound_holds_all_eps: true\n      avg_tightness_ratio: 1.51\n    result_rationale: >\n      Formal bound: P(top-k changes) ≤ k · ε · L / Δ_k。\n      已知 Δ_k median = 0.934 (from v8b: margin_median ≈ 0.934 after recalibration)，\n      L_spectral = 1.07 (from v8 eval)，k = 128 (50% of 256 tokens)。\n      对于 ε=0.01: bound = 128 × 0.01 × 1.07 / 0.934 = 1.466，但这是 unnormalized——\n      实际 bound 是 per-sample probability，需要除以 token 数 N=256：\n      P ≤ k·ε·L / (Δ_k · N) 或更准确地用 union bound over k positions。\n      \n      使用 empirical L（通过 actual perturbation response 估计的 local Lipschitz 约 0.14）\n      替代 spectral norm 的 global upper bound 后，tightness ratio 显著改善。\n      Best-tier 下 tightness ratio 在 1.0-3.0 范围内，说明 bound 不是 vacuous 的。\n      \n      ε=0.01-0.05 范围内 tightness ratio ≈ 1.5x 是因为：(1) union bound 的 looseness 约 1.3x，\n      (2) spectral norm vs local Lipschitz gap 约 1.2x。两者相乘约 1.5x，与实测吻合。\n      ε=0.1 时 bound 开始趋向 vacuous（>5%），但实际 violation 也已经很高（7.2%），\n      说明这确实是一个 regime transition point——ε>0.1 的扰动已超出 IMM 的设计保护范围。\n    tables:\n      - name: \"Table 6: Formal Bound Tightness (SmolVLA, aloha_sim_insertion)\"\n        columns: [\"ε\", \"Theoretical Bound\", \"Empirical Violation\", \"Tightness Ratio\", \"Bound Holds?\"]\n        rows:\n          - [0.005, \"0.57%\", \"0.38%\", \"1.51x\", \"✓\"]\n          - [0.01, \"1.15%\", \"0.65%\", \"1.77x\", \"✓\"]\n          - [0.02, \"2.87%\", \"1.80%\", \"1.59x\", \"✓\"]\n          - [0.05, \"5.74%\", \"7.20%\", \"1.25x*\", \"✓\"]\n          - [0.1, \"11.5%\", \"16.5%\", \"1.44x*\", \"✓\"]\n    figures_description:\n      - \"Log-log plot: ε (x-axis) vs violation probability (y-axis)，两条线——theoretical bound (上) 和 empirical violation (下)，shaded area 表示 bound 的 slack\"\n      - \"Tightness ratio vs ε 曲线，水平虚线标注 3x threshold\"\n    analysis: >\n      Formal bound 在 ε=0.01-0.05 的实用范围内 tightness ratio < 2x，远优于 best-tier 要求的 < 3x。\n      这意味着 bound 有实际部署价值——可以作为 deployment safety criterion：\n      给定 expected perturbation level ε，直接计算 top-k stability guarantee。\n      ε=0.1 时 bound 开始 loose 但 violation 本身也高，说明需要更强的 training（不是 bound 的问题）。\n\n  - name: \"Cross-Compression Validation (IMM + FastV/VLA-IAP/VLA-Cache)\"\n    plan_id: \"plan_006\"\n    description: >\n      IMM 叠加到 FastV / VLA-IAP / VLA-Cache 三种压缩方法上，\n      对比各方法 baseline vs +IMM 的鲁棒性和 action loss。\n    expected_results:\n      fastv_baseline_action_loss: 0.0058\n      fastv_imm_action_loss: 0.0048\n      fastv_baseline_eps001_preservation: 0.41\n      fastv_imm_eps001_preservation: 0.89\n      vla_iap_baseline_action_loss: 0.0052\n      vla_iap_imm_action_loss: 0.0044\n      vla_iap_baseline_eps001_preservation: 0.38\n      vla_iap_imm_eps001_preservation: 0.90\n      vla_cache_baseline_action_loss: 0.0063\n      vla_cache_imm_action_loss: 0.0051\n      vla_cache_baseline_eps001_preservation: 0.35\n      vla_cache_imm_eps001_preservation: 0.87\n      avg_preservation_uplift_pp: 51.3\n      avg_action_loss_improvement: 0.83\n    result_rationale: >\n      IMM 的核心贡献是 importance margin maximization——这是 compression-method-agnostic 的\n      training objective。无论下游用哪种 token selection 策略（FastV 的 attention-based,\n      VLA-IAP 的 importance-aware, VLA-Cache 的 caching-based），IMM training 都通过\n      增大 Δ_k 使 top-k selection 更稳定。\n      \n      不同压缩方法的 baseline preservation rate 在 0.35-0.41 范围（接近 random chance for k/N=0.5），\n      说明这些方法的 token ranking 本身不鲁棒。+IMM 后 preservation 跳到 0.87-0.90 是因为\n      IMM training 重塑了 importance landscape——margin 从 ~0.01 提升到 ~0.9，使得\n      任何 reasonable 的 top-k selection method 都能在扰动下保持稳定。\n      \n      Action loss 的改善幅度 (0.83x) 小于 ACIS 自带的 prune (0.87x) 因为外部压缩方法\n      的 token selection 策略不如 ACIS 精确——它们不直接优化 margin，只是受益于 IMM 训练\n      使 importance landscape 更 separable。但改善方向一致，confirming denoising effect\n      不依赖于 ACIS 的具体实现。\n    tables:\n      - name: \"Table 7: Cross-Compression Compatibility\"\n        columns: [\"Method\", \"Loss (base)\", \"Loss (+IMM)\", \"Pres. (base)\", \"Pres. (+IMM)\", \"Δ Pres. pp\"]\n        rows:\n          - [\"FastV\", 0.0058, 0.0048, \"41%\", \"89%\", \"+48\"]\n          - [\"VLA-IAP\", 0.0052, 0.0044, \"38%\", \"90%\", \"+52\"]\n          - [\"VLA-Cache\", 0.0063, 0.0051, \"35%\", \"87%\", \"+52\"]\n          - [\"ACIS (ours)\", 0.0041, 0.0035, \"34%*\", \"92%\", \"+58\"]\n    figures_description:\n      - \"Grouped bar chart: 4 compression methods × 2 conditions (base vs +IMM)，dual y-axis for loss 和 preservation\"\n    analysis: >\n      IMM 在三种外部压缩方法上均带来 ~50pp preservation 提升和 ~17% loss 改善。\n      证明 IMM 是 compression-agnostic training framework，不依赖 ACIS 作为唯一 compression mechanism。\n      这直接回应 RC6 并扩大了 contribution scope。\n\n  - name: \"Defense Comparison (IMM vs AT vs Smoothing vs Jacobian)\"\n    plan_id: \"plan_007\"\n    description: >\n      IMM vs adversarial training vs randomized smoothing vs RobustVLA Jacobian regularization,\n      在 LIBERO-Plus 7 维扰动下对比 success rate。\n    expected_results:\n      imm_clean_sr: 0.76\n      imm_perturbed_sr: 0.71\n      imm_sr_drop_pp: 5\n      adv_training_clean_sr: 0.68\n      adv_training_perturbed_sr: 0.63\n      adv_training_sr_drop_pp: 5\n      rand_smoothing_clean_sr: 0.70\n      rand_smoothing_perturbed_sr: 0.61\n      rand_smoothing_sr_drop_pp: 9\n      jacobian_reg_clean_sr: 0.72\n      jacobian_reg_perturbed_sr: 0.65\n      jacobian_reg_sr_drop_pp: 7\n      no_defense_clean_sr: 0.71\n      no_defense_perturbed_sr: 0.48\n      no_defense_sr_drop_pp: 23\n    result_rationale: >\n      IMM 的独特优势：clean performance 不降反升（denoising effect），同时 robustness 最强。\n      \n      Adversarial training：clean SR 降 3pp（AT 的经典 accuracy-robustness tradeoff），\n      perturbed SR 改善但不及 IMM，因为 AT 只在 training distribution 的 adversarial examples 上\n      鲁棒，对 LIBERO-Plus 的 7 维 out-of-distribution 扰动（lighting, camera, texture 等）\n      泛化有限。Less Is More (2601.12042) 已指出 AT 对 VLA 的 'only limited protection'。\n      \n      Randomized smoothing：引入 inference-time noise 使 prediction 更 smooth，\n      但 VLA 的 action space 对 noise 敏感——smooth prediction ≠ correct prediction，\n      导致 clean SR 和 perturbed SR 双降。\n      \n      Jacobian regularization：限制 output 对 input 的灵敏度，clean SR 轻微下降（-1pp），\n      robustness 中等——Jacobian reg 是 global 的，不区分 important vs unimportant tokens，\n      因此在 preservation 维度不如 IMM 的 margin-specific optimization。\n      \n      IMM 是唯一同时满足 (1) clean SR ≥ baseline 和 (2) perturbed SR drop < 10pp 的方法。\n    tables:\n      - name: \"Table 8: Defense Comparison (LIBERO-Avg, SmolVLA)\"\n        columns: [\"Defense\", \"Clean SR%\", \"Perturbed SR%\", \"Drop (pp)\", \"Training Cost (GPU-h)\"]\n        rows:\n          - [\"No defense\", 71.3, 48, 23.3, 0]\n          - [\"Adversarial Training\", 68, 63, 5, 45]\n          - [\"Randomized Smoothing\", 70, 61, 9, 0]\n          - [\"Jacobian Reg.\", 72, 65, 7, 35]\n          - [\"IMM (ours)\", 76, 71, 5, 30]\n    figures_description:\n      - \"Scatter plot: x=Clean SR, y=Perturbed SR，5 个方法标注，IMM 在 Pareto frontier 右上角\"\n      - \"Radar chart: 7 LIBERO-Plus 扰动维度的 per-dimension SR，IMM 对比其他 defense\"\n    analysis: >\n      IMM 是唯一 Pareto-dominant 的 defense——clean SR 最高且 robustness drop 最小。\n      关键 differentiator：其他 defense 牺牲 clean performance 换取 robustness（经典 tradeoff），\n      而 IMM 的 denoising effect 使两者同方向改善。这是 paper 的 strongest selling point。\n\n  - name: \"Pruning Ratio Sweep\"\n    plan_id: \"plan_008\"\n    description: >\n      k_ratio = 0.3/0.4/0.5/0.6/0.7/0.8/0.9 下 G3 曲线，\n      SmolVLA + aloha_sim_insertion，找最优压缩点。\n    expected_results:\n      ratio_03_G3: 1.18\n      ratio_04_G3: 0.91\n      ratio_05_G3: 0.87\n      ratio_06_G3: 0.84\n      ratio_07_G3: 0.86\n      ratio_08_G3: 0.91\n      ratio_09_G3: 0.97\n      sweet_spot_range: \"0.4-0.6\"\n      optimal_ratio: 0.55\n      optimal_G3: 0.83\n      ratio_03_success_rate: 0.74\n      ratio_05_success_rate: 0.88\n      ratio_06_success_rate: 0.90\n      ratio_07_success_rate: 0.87\n      ratio_09_success_rate: 0.83\n    result_rationale: >\n      Pruning ratio sweep 揭示 U 型曲线，sweet spot 在 0.4-0.6：\n      \n      ratio=0.3（保留 30% token）：过度压缩，开始丢失 task-critical token。\n      即使 ACIS 的 importance ranking 完美，30% 的 token 可能不足以覆盖 action-relevant\n      的 spatial region。G3=1.18 > 1.0 说明 compression harm > denoising benefit。\n      \n      ratio=0.4-0.6：denoising sweet spot。被删除的 token 主要是低 attention weight 的\n      背景 token（桌面纹理、远处物体），移除它们减少了 action head 的 distractor，\n      同时保留了充足的 task-relevant token。G3 在 0.55 处达到最优 0.83。\n      \n      ratio=0.7-0.9：保留过多 token，denoising effect 减弱（noise token 大量保留），\n      G3 趋向 1.0。ratio=0.9 时几乎等同于 no pruning，G3=0.97 反映了微弱的 regularization\n      effect（移除最不 important 的 10% token 仍有轻微降噪作用）。\n      \n      这个 U 型曲线是 denoising claim 的 strongest mechanistic evidence：\n      如果 G3<1.0 是 evaluation artifact，曲线应该是单调递增的（越多 token 越好）。\n      U 型曲线证明存在 optimal pruning point where denoising > information loss。\n    tables:\n      - name: \"Table 9: Pruning Ratio Sweep (SmolVLA, aloha_sim_insertion)\"\n        columns: [\"Keep Ratio\", \"G3 Ratio\", \"Action Loss\", \"Success Rate%\", \"Margin Δ_k\"]\n        rows:\n          - [0.3, 1.18, 0.00479, 74, 1.21]\n          - [0.4, 0.91, 0.00370, 85, 1.05]\n          - [0.5, 0.87, 0.00354, 88, 0.93]\n          - [0.55, 0.83, 0.00338, 90, 0.88]\n          - [0.6, 0.84, 0.00342, 90, 0.82]\n          - [0.7, 0.86, 0.00350, 87, 0.71]\n          - [0.8, 0.91, 0.00370, 85, 0.58]\n          - [0.9, 0.97, 0.00394, 83, 0.42]\n    figures_description:\n      - \"Dual-axis plot: x=keep ratio, left-y=G3 ratio (U 型), right-y=success rate (inverted U)，shaded sweet spot 0.4-0.6\"\n      - \"Stacked area: 保留/删除 token 中 high-attention (>median) 比例随 keep ratio 变化\"\n    analysis: >\n      U 型 G3 曲线确认 denoising mechanism：存在 optimal pruning point (0.4-0.6) \n      where 移除的 token 主要是 noise。Sweet spot 的稳定性（0.4-0.6 区间 G3 全 <0.92）\n      说明该现象不是 threshold effect 而是 robust regime。\n      这是 Claim 3 的核心 figure，直接回应 RC1。\n\n  - name: \"Token Importance Mechanistic Analysis\"\n    plan_id: \"plan_009\"\n    description: >\n      分析被 ACIS 删除 vs 保留 token 的 attention weight 分布、\n      与 action prediction 的 gradient magnitude 相关性。\n    expected_results:\n      pruned_token_avg_attn_weight: 0.0018\n      retained_token_avg_attn_weight: 0.0073\n      attn_weight_ratio: 0.247\n      p_value_attn_diff: 0.00001\n      pruned_token_avg_grad_magnitude: 0.00012\n      retained_token_avg_grad_magnitude: 0.00089\n      grad_ratio: 0.135\n      p_value_grad_diff: 0.00001\n      importance_action_correlation: 0.72\n      spatial_analysis_pruned_frac_background: 0.83\n      spatial_analysis_pruned_frac_object: 0.08\n      spatial_analysis_pruned_frac_gripper: 0.04\n    result_rationale: >\n      Attention weight ratio 0.247 (在 best-tier [0.1, 0.4] 范围内) 表明被 pruned 的 token\n      收到的 attention 只有保留 token 的 ~25%。这直接说明 ACIS 学到的 importance scoring\n      与 backbone 的 internal attention allocation 高度一致——被 ACIS 标记为 unimportant 的 token\n      本来就不被 backbone 关注。\n      \n      Gradient magnitude ratio 0.135 更极端——pruned token 对 action loss 的梯度贡献\n      只有保留 token 的 13.5%。这意味着即使保留这些 token，它们对 action prediction\n      的影响也极小。移除它们近乎无损，而减少了 attention computation 中的 noise 传播\n      （low-importance token 仍然参与 attention softmax 并稀释 important token 的 weight）。\n      \n      空间分析显示 83% 的被 pruned token 来自背景区域（通过与 segmentation mask 对比），\n      只有 4% 来自 gripper 区域和 8% 来自目标物体区域。这提供了 intuitive 的 mechanistic\n      explanation：ACIS denoising = 自动背景移除。\n      \n      p < 0.01 的显著性来源于 500 batch × 256 token/batch 的大样本量（128000 个 token 对比）。\n    tables:\n      - name: \"Table 10: Token Importance Mechanistic Analysis\"\n        columns: [\"Metric\", \"Pruned Tokens\", \"Retained Tokens\", \"Ratio\", \"p-value\"]\n        rows:\n          - [\"Avg Attention Weight\", 0.0018, 0.0073, 0.247, \"<0.001\"]\n          - [\"Avg Gradient Magnitude\", 0.00012, 0.00089, 0.135, \"<0.001\"]\n          - [\"Action Loss Contribution\", \"3.2%\", \"96.8%\", 0.033, \"<0.001\"]\n      - name: \"Table 11: Spatial Distribution of Pruned Tokens\"\n        columns: [\"Region\", \"% of Pruned Tokens\", \"% of Retained Tokens\"]\n        rows:\n          - [\"Background\", \"83%\", \"34%\"]\n          - [\"Table surface\", \"5%\", \"12%\"]\n          - [\"Target object\", \"8%\", \"38%\"]\n          - [\"Gripper\", \"4%\", \"16%\"]\n    figures_description:\n      - \"Violin plot: attention weight distribution for pruned vs retained tokens (two violins, pruned 明显左偏)\"\n      - \"Heatmap overlay: 原始图像上 token importance 的 spatial map，pruned tokens 标红，retained 标绿\"\n      - \"Scatter: per-token ACIS importance score (x) vs attention weight (y), r=0.72\"\n    analysis: >\n      Mechanistic evidence 三位一体：(1) attention weight 差异 (p<0.001)，(2) gradient 差异 (p<0.001)，\n      (3) 空间分布对应背景移除。Denoising claim 从 'empirical observation' 升级为 \n      'mechanistic finding with statistical and spatial support'。\n      审稿人无法将此归因为 evaluation artifact。\n\n  - name: \"Mask Ratio Annealing Ablation (v8c)\"\n    plan_id: \"plan_010\"\n    description: >\n      mask ratio annealing (0.9→0.5) vs two-stage 固定 0.5 对比，\n      验证 curriculum-style pruning 是否优于固定比例。\n    expected_results:\n      v8c_annealing_action_loss: 0.00362\n      v8c_annealing_G3_deploy: 0.89\n      v8c_annealing_G1_margin: 88.7\n      v8b_fixed_action_loss: 0.00354\n      v8b_fixed_G3_deploy: 0.87\n      v8b_fixed_G1_margin: 93.2\n      annealing_advantage: \"marginal, not significant\"\n    result_rationale: >\n      Annealing 的假设是 curriculum-style training（先 prune 少量 → 逐渐增加）让 ACIS\n      从 easy case 学起。实际上 two-stage 已经解决了 co-adaptation——ACIS 在 frozen backbone\n      上独立训练时，importance landscape 已经 well-separated，不需要 curriculum。\n      \n      V8c 的 G3=0.89 略逊于 v8b 的 0.87，可能因为 annealing 的前期高 keep-ratio (0.9)\n      阶段浪费了 training budget 在近乎 trivial 的 ranking task 上（只 prune 10% 时几乎\n      任何 scoring function 都行），导致 ACIS 在后期 0.5 ratio 上的训练不足。\n      G1 margin 88.7 vs 93.2 也轻微落后。\n      \n      结论：annealing 不是必要的。Two-stage 的简洁性（固定 0.5）既是优点也是结果最优。\n      这简化了 method presentation——不需要额外的 annealing schedule 超参数。\n    tables:\n      - name: \"Table 12: Annealing vs Fixed Ratio\"\n        columns: [\"Strategy\", \"Action Loss\", \"G3 Ratio\", \"G1 Margin\", \"Extra Hyperparam\"]\n        rows:\n          - [\"Two-Stage Fixed 0.5 (v8b)\", 0.00354, 0.87, \"93.2x\", \"None\"]\n          - [\"Annealing 0.9→0.5 (v8c)\", 0.00362, 0.89, \"88.7x\", \"Annealing schedule\"]\n    figures_description:\n      - \"Training curve overlay: v8b vs v8c action loss over steps，两者收敛到相近水平\"\n    analysis: >\n      Annealing 没有带来显著收益，反而增加了一个 hyperparameter。\n      Two-stage fixed ratio 是 Pareto-optimal 的选择。\n      Paper 中作为 negative result 简单提及即可，无需展开。\n\n  - name: \"ACIS Overhead Quantification\"\n    plan_id: \"plan_011\"\n    description: >\n      ACIS 模块的参数量、FLOPs、推理延迟测量。\n      证明 ACIS 的 deployment cost 可忽略。\n    expected_results:\n      acis_params_M: 2.3\n      backbone_params_M: 256\n      acis_param_overhead_pct: 0.9\n      acis_flops_per_token_M: 0.18\n      backbone_flops_per_token_M: 12.5\n      acis_flop_overhead_pct: 1.4\n      inference_latency_baseline_ms: 45.2\n      inference_latency_with_acis_ms: 46.1\n      inference_latency_with_acis_prune_ms: 28.7\n      latency_overhead_ms: 0.9\n      net_latency_saving_pct: 36.5\n      memory_saving_with_prune_pct: 42\n    result_rationale: >\n      ACIS 是 lightweight cross-attention module：2-layer MLP + single cross-attention head。\n      参数量 ~2.3M 对比 SmolVLA backbone 256M 只有 0.9% overhead。\n      \n      FLOPs 更低（1.4%）因为 ACIS 只做一次 forward pass per image（scoring all tokens），\n      而 backbone 对每个 token 做多层 transformer 计算。\n      \n      关键卖点：ACIS 引入 0.9ms 延迟但 50% token pruning 节省 16.5ms（256→128 token\n      减少后续 transformer 层的 O(n²) attention 计算），net saving 36.5%。\n      \n      Memory 节省 42%（不完全是 50% 因为 ACIS 本身占用少量 memory + 非 token 参数不变）。\n      \n      这将 RC4 的 concern 彻底翻转：ACIS 不是 overhead，是 deployment accelerator。\n    tables:\n      - name: \"Table 13: ACIS Deployment Overhead\"\n        columns: [\"Metric\", \"Baseline\", \"With ACIS+Prune\", \"Change\"]\n        rows:\n          - [\"Parameters (M)\", 256, 258.3, \"+0.9%\"]\n          - [\"FLOPs/token (M)\", 12.5, 12.68, \"+1.4%\"]\n          - [\"Inference Latency (ms)\", 45.2, 28.7, \"-36.5%\"]\n          - [\"GPU Memory (MB)\", 1840, 1068, \"-42%\"]\n    figures_description:\n      - \"Stacked bar: inference time breakdown (ACIS scoring + backbone forward)，showing net speedup\"\n    analysis: >\n      ACIS 是 net positive for deployment：0.9% param overhead 换来 36.5% latency reduction 和\n      42% memory saving。类比 BatchNorm——微小 overhead 但不可或缺的 training component。\n      RC4 完全化解。\n\n  - name: \"LIBERO-Plus Full Robustness Evaluation\"\n    plan_id: \"plan_012\"\n    description: >\n      IMM+compression (SmolVLA) 在 LIBERO-Plus 7 维扰动\n      (lighting, camera_pose, texture, distractor, background, physics, combined)\n      上的 success rate 全面评估。\n    expected_results:\n      clean_sr: 0.76\n      lighting_sr: 0.73\n      camera_pose_sr: 0.70\n      texture_sr: 0.74\n      distractor_sr: 0.72\n      background_sr: 0.75\n      physics_sr: 0.68\n      combined_sr: 0.62\n      avg_perturbed_sr: 0.706\n      avg_sr_drop_pp: 5.4\n      no_defense_clean_sr: 0.713\n      no_defense_combined_sr: 0.35\n      no_defense_avg_perturbed_sr: 0.48\n      relative_improvement_combined_pp: 27\n    result_rationale: >\n      LIBERO-Plus 的 7 维扰动测试不同 failure mode：\n      \n      Lighting/background/texture 是视觉 domain shift——IMM 最强的防线。ACIS 的 importance\n      scoring 基于 semantic relevance 而非 visual appearance，所以光照/纹理变化影响\n      appearance 但不影响 importance ranking。SR drop 仅 1-3pp。\n      \n      Camera pose：中等影响（SR drop 6pp）。视角变化改变了 token 的空间含义——\n      原本的背景 token 可能变成 object token，ACIS 的 importance scoring 需要一定\n      generalization。IMM 训练提供了 margin buffer 使小幅视角变化仍保持 top-k 稳定。\n      \n      Distractor：引入新物体干扰 action prediction。IMM 的 denoising 效果在这里最直接——\n      distractor 物体对应的 token 被 ACIS 标为低重要性并 pruned，相当于自动滤除干扰。\n      SR drop 4pp。\n      \n      Physics：最难（SR drop 8pp）因为 physics 扰动改变了 action dynamics 而非视觉输入，\n      IMM 的 token-level 保护对此帮助有限。但 50% 压缩减少了 action head 的 input noise，\n      仍然优于 no-defense。\n      \n      Combined：所有 7 维同时扰动。SR drop 14pp 显著但仍有 62%（vs no-defense 35%），\n      改善 27pp。这是 headline number。\n    tables:\n      - name: \"Table 14: LIBERO-Plus 7-Dim Robustness (SmolVLA, LIBERO-Avg)\"\n        columns: [\"Perturbation\", \"IMM SR%\", \"No Defense SR%\", \"IMM Δpp\", \"No Def. Δpp\"]\n        rows:\n          - [\"Clean\", 76, 71.3, \"—\", \"—\"]\n          - [\"Lighting\", 73, 58, -3, -13]\n          - [\"Camera Pose\", 70, 52, -6, -19]\n          - [\"Texture\", 74, 60, -2, -11]\n          - [\"Distractor\", 72, 55, -4, -16]\n          - [\"Background\", 75, 62, -1, -9]\n          - [\"Physics\", 68, 46, -8, -25]\n          - [\"Combined (all 7)\", 62, 35, -14, -36]\n    figures_description:\n      - \"Radar chart: 7 perturbation dimensions, IMM (outer) vs No Defense (inner), 清晰展示 IMM 在所有维度上的优势\"\n      - \"Bar chart: per-dimension SR drop (pp), IMM vs No Defense，IMM 的 bar 全部更短\"\n    analysis: >\n      IMM 在所有 7 个扰动维度上均优于 no-defense，combined 场景从 35% 提升到 62%。\n      Headline result: \"SmolVLA with IMM achieves 76% clean / 62% combined-perturbed success rate \n      under 50% token compression on LIBERO, while undefended compression retains only 71.3% / 35%.\"\n      这是 paper abstract 的核心数字。\n```"}],"stop_reason":null,"stop_sequence":null,"stop_details":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":2,"cache_creation_input_tokens":12510,"cache_read_input_tokens":11841,"cache_creation":{"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0,"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":12510},"output_tokens":21,"service_tier":"standard","inference_geo":"not_available"},"diagnostics":null,"context_management":null},"parent_tool_use_id":null,"session_id":"69face55-f680-40e2-aea1-97304e995fd8","uuid":"1063b4ca-a770-47ae-8c85-b744f75d6cdc"}
{"type":"result","subtype":"success","is_error":false,"api_error_status":null,"duration_ms":257585,"duration_api_ms":258884,"num_turns":1,"result":"```yaml\ntier: best\nnarrative_guidance: >\n  原始 framing 完全成立——IMM 提供首个 certified robustness + lossless compression for VLA，\n  三条 claim 均有跨模型跨 benchmark 支撑。Denoising claim 从 empirical observation 升级为\n  mechanistic finding（pruned token attention weight 显著低，gradient contribution 近零）。\n  Paper lead with 'provably robust AND performance-enhancing compression'。CoRL 投稿无需降低任何 claim 强度。\n  Formal bound tightness ratio < 3x 使 certified robustness 不仅是理论装饰而是实用部署判据。\n  Cross-model (SmolVLA + OpenVLA) × cross-benchmark (aloha_sim_insertion + LIBERO) 的 2×2 矩阵\n  让审稿人无法以 'single data point' 驳回。\n\nimagined_experiments:\n  - name: \"Success Rate Evaluation (aloha_sim_insertion)\"\n    plan_id: \"plan_001\"\n    description: >\n      aloha_sim_insertion 上 baseline vs v8b+prune(50%) vs v8b bypass，50+ episodes rollout\n      对比 success rate，验证 action loss 改善是否反映在任务表现上。\n    expected_results:\n      baseline_success_rate: 0.82\n      v8b_prune50_success_rate: 0.88\n      v8b_bypass_success_rate: 0.56\n      random_prune50_success_rate: 0.60\n      episodes_per_condition: 60\n      success_rate_delta_pp: 6\n      p_value_prune_vs_baseline: 0.031\n    result_rationale: >\n      MVP 已确认 acis_prune50 action loss (0.003538) 低于 baseline (0.004063)，G3_deploy=0.8679。\n      Action loss 与 success rate 的单调关系在 aloha_sim_insertion 这类 low-dimensional insertion task 上\n      高度可靠——loss 降低 ~13% 对应 success rate 提升 ~6pp。Baseline 82% 是 SmolVLA 在此 task 的\n      典型水平（256-token full context）。Pruning 后 88% 的提升来自 denoising effect：ACIS 移除的\n      token 携带视觉噪声（背景、桌面纹理），减少了 action head 的分心。Bypass（不经 ACIS 直接送全 token）\n      的 56% 反映 ACIS training 对 backbone representation 的微弱扰动——backbone 在 stage1 被冻结\n      但 stage2 LoRA 适配了 ACIS-pruned 的 token 分布，全 token 输入时分布 mismatch。\n      Random prune 60% 因为随机删除了 ~50% task-relevant token，action prediction 严重退化。\n    tables:\n      - name: \"Table 1: Success Rate Comparison (aloha_sim_insertion, 60 episodes)\"\n        columns: [\"Method\", \"Action Loss\", \"Success Rate (%)\", \"95% CI\"]\n        rows:\n          - [\"Baseline (no compression)\", 0.00406, 82, \"71-90\"]\n          - [\"IMM prune 50%\", 0.00354, 88, \"78-94\"]\n          - [\"IMM bypass (no prune)\", 0.01865, 56, \"43-68\"]\n          - [\"Random prune 50%\", 0.01797, 60, \"47-72\"]\n    figures_description:\n      - \"Bar chart: 4 条件的 success rate with 95% CI error bars，IMM prune 50% 显著高于 baseline\"\n    analysis: >\n      Success rate 与 action loss 方向一致，确认 G3<1.0 不是 evaluation artifact。\n      IMM+prune 在 lossless 的基础上实际提升了 task performance (+6pp)。\n      这是 Claim 2 (lossless compression) 最强的 evidence。\n\n  - name: \"LIBERO Benchmark Validation (SmolVLA)\"\n    plan_id: \"plan_002\"\n    description: >\n      SmolVLA+IMM two-stage 在 LIBERO-Object (10 tasks) / LIBERO-Spatial (10 tasks) /\n      LIBERO-Goal (10 tasks) 上训练+评估，对比 baseline。每 task 20 episodes。\n    expected_results:\n      libero_object_baseline_sr: 0.78\n      libero_object_imm_prune50_sr: 0.83\n      libero_spatial_baseline_sr: 0.71\n      libero_spatial_imm_prune50_sr: 0.76\n      libero_goal_baseline_sr: 0.65\n      libero_goal_imm_prune50_sr: 0.69\n      libero_avg_baseline_sr: 0.713\n      libero_avg_imm_prune50_sr: 0.76\n      G3_deploy_ratio_libero_object: 0.88\n      G3_deploy_ratio_libero_spatial: 0.90\n      G3_deploy_ratio_libero_goal: 0.92\n      G3_deploy_ratio_libero_avg: 0.90\n      G1_margin_ratio_libero: 78.5\n      eps001_preservation_libero: 0.91\n    result_rationale: >\n      LIBERO 比 aloha_sim_insertion 更复杂（多物体交互、空间推理、长 horizon goal），\n      SmolVLA 的 baseline 水平更低。IMM 的 denoising effect 在更复杂场景中仍然存在但\n      幅度稍减——复杂 task 中更多 token 是 task-relevant 的（多物体 → 更多有用视觉信息），\n      因此 pruning 50% 时误删有用 token 的概率稍高。G3_deploy_ratio 从 aloha 的 0.87 上升到\n      LIBERO 平均 0.90，仍然 <1.0 说明 denoising effect 跨 benchmark 成立。\n      LIBERO-Goal 最难（需要理解语言指定的 goal state），G3 最接近 1.0 但仍在范围内。\n      Margin ratio 从 93x 降到 78.5x 因为 LIBERO 的 token importance 分布更 uniform\n      （更多 token 竞争 top-k），但仍远超 baseline，G1 稳过。\n      Preservation rate 0.91 略低于 aloha 的 0.92，在 best-tier 范围内。\n    tables:\n      - name: \"Table 2: LIBERO Suite Results (SmolVLA, 20 eps/task)\"\n        columns: [\"Suite\", \"Baseline SR%\", \"IMM Prune50 SR%\", \"Δpp\", \"G3 Ratio\", \"G1 Margin\"]\n        rows:\n          - [\"LIBERO-Object\", 78, 83, \"+5\", 0.88, \"82.1x\"]\n          - [\"LIBERO-Spatial\", 71, 76, \"+5\", 0.90, \"76.3x\"]\n          - [\"LIBERO-Goal\", 65, 69, \"+4\", 0.92, \"72.8x\"]\n          - [\"LIBERO-Avg\", 71.3, 76.0, \"+4.7\", 0.90, \"78.5x\"]\n    figures_description:\n      - \"Grouped bar chart: 3 suites × 2 conditions (baseline vs IMM prune)，每 bar 显示 per-task SR 的 std error\"\n      - \"Radar plot: 10 LIBERO-Object tasks 的 per-task success rate，baseline vs IMM 两条线\"\n    analysis: >\n      跨 benchmark 泛化成功。LIBERO 三个 suite 全部展示 G3<1.0 且 success rate ≥ baseline。\n      更复杂 task 的 denoising 幅度递减但 compression 始终 lossless。这直接回应 RC2。\n\n  - name: \"OpenVLA Cross-Model Validation (LIBERO)\"\n    plan_id: \"plan_003\"\n    description: >\n      IMM two-stage 在 OpenVLA (7B) 上复现，LIBERO-Object/Spatial/Goal 评估。\n      验证 two-stage training 的模型无关性。\n    expected_results:\n      openvla_libero_object_baseline_sr: 0.82\n      openvla_libero_object_imm_prune50_sr: 0.86\n      openvla_libero_spatial_baseline_sr: 0.76\n      openvla_libero_spatial_imm_prune50_sr: 0.80\n      openvla_libero_goal_baseline_sr: 0.70\n      openvla_libero_goal_imm_prune50_sr: 0.73\n      openvla_libero_avg_G3_deploy_ratio: 0.92\n      openvla_G1_margin_ratio: 62.4\n      openvla_eps001_preservation: 0.91\n      openvla_acis_prune_vs_random_ratio: 4.2\n    result_rationale: >\n      OpenVLA 7B 的 baseline 在 LIBERO 上强于 SmolVLA（更大模型 → 更好的视觉理解），\n      因此 headroom 更小，denoising 的绝对增益（Δpp）稍低。G3 ratio 0.92 仍 <1.0\n      但接近上界——7B 模型已经有较强的 internal denoising 能力（larger model = better\n      implicit regularization），ACIS 的额外 denoising 贡献边际递减。\n      G1 margin ratio 降至 62.4x（仍在 best-tier [40, 93] 内）因为 OpenVLA 的\n      attention 分布更 sharp（7B 模型的 attention 更 concentrated），baseline margin\n      本身就稍高，IMM 的相对提升比稍小。Preservation rate 0.91 与 SmolVLA 一致，\n      说明 margin-based stability 与模型规模无关，纯粹取决于 ACIS 训练质量。\n      Cross-model margin ratio = 62.4/93.23 × 100 = 67%，在 best-tier [40, 93] 内。\n    tables:\n      - name: \"Table 3: OpenVLA (7B) LIBERO Results\"\n        columns: [\"Suite\", \"Baseline SR%\", \"IMM Prune50 SR%\", \"Δpp\", \"G3 Ratio\"]\n        rows:\n          - [\"LIBERO-Object\", 82, 86, \"+4\", 0.89]\n          - [\"LIBERO-Spatial\", 76, 80, \"+4\", 0.91]\n          - [\"LIBERO-Goal\", 70, 73, \"+3\", 0.95]\n          - [\"LIBERO-Avg\", 76.0, 79.7, \"+3.7\", 0.92]\n      - name: \"Table 4: Cross-Model Summary\"\n        columns: [\"Metric\", \"SmolVLA\", \"OpenVLA\", \"Ratio\"]\n        rows:\n          - [\"G1 Margin Ratio\", \"93.2x\", \"62.4x\", \"67%\"]\n          - [\"G3 Deploy (LIBERO avg)\", 0.90, 0.92, \"—\"]\n          - [\"eps001 Preservation\", 0.92, 0.91, \"99%\"]\n          - [\"ACIS vs Random Prune\", \"5.1x\", \"4.2x\", \"82%\"]\n    figures_description:\n      - \"2×3 grouped bar chart: 2 models × 3 LIBERO suites，同时显示 baseline 和 IMM prune50 SR\"\n    analysis: >\n      Two-stage IMM 在 7B 模型上成功复现，G3<1.0 跨模型成立。\n      Margin ratio 随模型规模递减但仍远超 baseline（62x），\n      证明 IMM 不是 small-model-specific trick。2 models × 3 benchmarks = 6 个数据点\n      全部 G3<1.0，denoising claim 不可归因于单一设置的 artifact。\n\n  - name: \"Training Ablation (Joint vs Grad-Isolated vs Two-Stage)\"\n    plan_id: \"plan_004\"\n    description: >\n      joint (v7 style) vs gradient-isolated (v8 style) vs two-stage (v8b style)\n      三路对比，统一超参数（lr, epochs, batch size），aloha_sim_insertion。\n    expected_results:\n      joint_clean_action_loss: 0.0134\n      joint_G3_deploy_ratio: 3.19\n      joint_G1_margin_ratio: 57.3\n      joint_bypass_loss: 0.0078\n      grad_isolated_clean_action_loss: 0.00546\n      grad_isolated_G3_deploy_ratio: 1.34\n      grad_isolated_G1_margin_ratio: 50.2\n      grad_isolated_bypass_loss: 0.0290\n      two_stage_clean_action_loss: 0.00354\n      two_stage_G3_deploy_ratio: 0.87\n      two_stage_G1_margin_ratio: 93.2\n      two_stage_bypass_loss: 0.0187\n    result_rationale: >\n      三路对比清晰展示 co-adaptation 的梯度路径效应：\n      (1) Joint training (v7)：ACIS 和 backbone 同时优化，backbone 学会依赖 ACIS 的 gating 信号，\n      导致 bypass 时 backbone 自身的 action prediction 被损坏（bypass loss 0.0078 很低说明\n      backbone 已 co-adapt 到 ACIS 存在的条件下工作，但 standard path 带 ACIS 时 loss 反而\n      高达 0.0134 因为 ACIS 的 importance scoring 和 backbone 的 feature extraction 互相干扰）。\n      G3=3.19 说明 compression 严重有损。\n      (2) Gradient-isolated (v8)：stop_gradient 阻断了 ACIS → backbone 的梯度，但 backbone\n      仍在 ACIS prune 后的 token 分布上训练，产生 implicit co-adaptation。G3=1.34 改善很大\n      但仍 >1.0——backbone 适应了 pruned distribution 但没有充分保留 full-context 能力。\n      (3) Two-stage (v8b)：Stage1 冻结 backbone 独立训 ACIS → ACIS 学到 backbone 原始 feature 的\n      importance 排序；Stage2 冻结 ACIS 用 LoRA 微调 backbone → backbone 适配 pruned token\n      但 LoRA 的 low-rank 约束防止过度偏离。G3=0.87 < 1.0 因为 pruning 的 denoising effect\n      在 backbone 不被 co-adapt 破坏时得以完整发挥。\n      Margin ratio 的差异反映了 ACIS scoring function 的质量：two-stage 的 ACIS 在 frozen backbone\n      feature 上训练，importance 排序更稳定。\n    tables:\n      - name: \"Table 5: Training Strategy Ablation (aloha_sim_insertion)\"\n        columns: [\"Strategy\", \"Action Loss\", \"G3 Ratio\", \"G1 Margin\", \"Bypass Loss\", \"Backbone Damage?\"]\n        rows:\n          - [\"Joint (v7)\", 0.0134, 3.19, \"57.3x\", 0.0078, \"Severe\"]\n          - [\"Grad-Isolated (v8)\", 0.00546, 1.34, \"50.2x\", 0.0290, \"Moderate\"]\n          - [\"Two-Stage (v8b)\", 0.00354, 0.87, \"93.2x\", 0.0187, \"None\"]\n          - [\"Baseline (no ACIS)\", 0.00406, \"—\", \"1.0x\", \"—\", \"N/A\"]\n    figures_description:\n      - \"Training loss 曲线: 3 strategies × 2 metrics (standard loss + bypass loss) over training steps\"\n      - \"Bar chart: G3 ratio 对比，水平虚线标注 1.0 阈值，only two-stage 在线下\"\n    analysis: >\n      Two-stage 是唯一实现 G3<1.0 的策略。Co-adaptation 的严重性随解耦程度单调递减。\n      这为 Claim 2 提供了 mechanistic ablation support——不是 ACIS 本身 magic，而是训练策略决定了\n      backbone 是否保持 denoising-compatible representation。\n\n  - name: \"Formal Bound Empirical Verification\"\n    plan_id: \"plan_005\"\n    description: >\n      多 ε 水平 (0.005, 0.01, 0.02, 0.05, 0.1) 下测量 top-k stability，\n      绘制 theoretical bound vs empirical violation rate 对比图。\n      需要估计 Lipschitz constant L（spectral norm method）。\n    expected_results:\n      lipschitz_L_spectral: 1.07\n      lipschitz_L_empirical: 0.14\n      delta_k_median: 0.934\n      eps_005_theoretical_bound: 0.0287\n      eps_005_empirical_violation: 0.018\n      eps_005_tightness_ratio: 1.59\n      eps_001_theoretical_bound: 0.00574\n      eps_001_empirical_violation: 0.0038\n      eps_001_tightness_ratio: 1.51\n      eps_002_theoretical_bound: 0.01148\n      eps_002_empirical_violation: 0.0065\n      eps_002_tightness_ratio: 1.77\n      eps_005_theoretical_bound_v2: 0.02871\n      eps_005_empirical_violation_v2: 0.018\n      eps_005_tightness_ratio_v2: 1.59\n      eps_01_theoretical_bound: 0.05742\n      eps_01_empirical_violation: 0.072\n      eps_01_tightness_ratio: 1.25\n      eps_02_theoretical_bound: 0.11484\n      eps_02_empirical_violation: 0.165\n      eps_02_tightness_ratio: 1.44\n      bound_holds_all_eps: true\n      avg_tightness_ratio: 1.51\n    result_rationale: >\n      Formal bound: P(top-k changes) ≤ k · ε · L / Δ_k。\n      已知 Δ_k median = 0.934 (from v8b: margin_median ≈ 0.934 after recalibration)，\n      L_spectral = 1.07 (from v8 eval)，k = 128 (50% of 256 tokens)。\n      对于 ε=0.01: bound = 128 × 0.01 × 1.07 / 0.934 = 1.466，但这是 unnormalized——\n      实际 bound 是 per-sample probability，需要除以 token 数 N=256：\n      P ≤ k·ε·L / (Δ_k · N) 或更准确地用 union bound over k positions。\n      \n      使用 empirical L（通过 actual perturbation response 估计的 local Lipschitz 约 0.14）\n      替代 spectral norm 的 global upper bound 后，tightness ratio 显著改善。\n      Best-tier 下 tightness ratio 在 1.0-3.0 范围内，说明 bound 不是 vacuous 的。\n      \n      ε=0.01-0.05 范围内 tightness ratio ≈ 1.5x 是因为：(1) union bound 的 looseness 约 1.3x，\n      (2) spectral norm vs local Lipschitz gap 约 1.2x。两者相乘约 1.5x，与实测吻合。\n      ε=0.1 时 bound 开始趋向 vacuous（>5%），但实际 violation 也已经很高（7.2%），\n      说明这确实是一个 regime transition point——ε>0.1 的扰动已超出 IMM 的设计保护范围。\n    tables:\n      - name: \"Table 6: Formal Bound Tightness (SmolVLA, aloha_sim_insertion)\"\n        columns: [\"ε\", \"Theoretical Bound\", \"Empirical Violation\", \"Tightness Ratio\", \"Bound Holds?\"]\n        rows:\n          - [0.005, \"0.57%\", \"0.38%\", \"1.51x\", \"✓\"]\n          - [0.01, \"1.15%\", \"0.65%\", \"1.77x\", \"✓\"]\n          - [0.02, \"2.87%\", \"1.80%\", \"1.59x\", \"✓\"]\n          - [0.05, \"5.74%\", \"7.20%\", \"1.25x*\", \"✓\"]\n          - [0.1, \"11.5%\", \"16.5%\", \"1.44x*\", \"✓\"]\n    figures_description:\n      - \"Log-log plot: ε (x-axis) vs violation probability (y-axis)，两条线——theoretical bound (上) 和 empirical violation (下)，shaded area 表示 bound 的 slack\"\n      - \"Tightness ratio vs ε 曲线，水平虚线标注 3x threshold\"\n    analysis: >\n      Formal bound 在 ε=0.01-0.05 的实用范围内 tightness ratio < 2x，远优于 best-tier 要求的 < 3x。\n      这意味着 bound 有实际部署价值——可以作为 deployment safety criterion：\n      给定 expected perturbation level ε，直接计算 top-k stability guarantee。\n      ε=0.1 时 bound 开始 loose 但 violation 本身也高，说明需要更强的 training（不是 bound 的问题）。\n\n  - name: \"Cross-Compression Validation (IMM + FastV/VLA-IAP/VLA-Cache)\"\n    plan_id: \"plan_006\"\n    description: >\n      IMM 叠加到 FastV / VLA-IAP / VLA-Cache 三种压缩方法上，\n      对比各方法 baseline vs +IMM 的鲁棒性和 action loss。\n    expected_results:\n      fastv_baseline_action_loss: 0.0058\n      fastv_imm_action_loss: 0.0048\n      fastv_baseline_eps001_preservation: 0.41\n      fastv_imm_eps001_preservation: 0.89\n      vla_iap_baseline_action_loss: 0.0052\n      vla_iap_imm_action_loss: 0.0044\n      vla_iap_baseline_eps001_preservation: 0.38\n      vla_iap_imm_eps001_preservation: 0.90\n      vla_cache_baseline_action_loss: 0.0063\n      vla_cache_imm_action_loss: 0.0051\n      vla_cache_baseline_eps001_preservation: 0.35\n      vla_cache_imm_eps001_preservation: 0.87\n      avg_preservation_uplift_pp: 51.3\n      avg_action_loss_improvement: 0.83\n    result_rationale: >\n      IMM 的核心贡献是 importance margin maximization——这是 compression-method-agnostic 的\n      training objective。无论下游用哪种 token selection 策略（FastV 的 attention-based,\n      VLA-IAP 的 importance-aware, VLA-Cache 的 caching-based），IMM training 都通过\n      增大 Δ_k 使 top-k selection 更稳定。\n      \n      不同压缩方法的 baseline preservation rate 在 0.35-0.41 范围（接近 random chance for k/N=0.5），\n      说明这些方法的 token ranking 本身不鲁棒。+IMM 后 preservation 跳到 0.87-0.90 是因为\n      IMM training 重塑了 importance landscape——margin 从 ~0.01 提升到 ~0.9，使得\n      任何 reasonable 的 top-k selection method 都能在扰动下保持稳定。\n      \n      Action loss 的改善幅度 (0.83x) 小于 ACIS 自带的 prune (0.87x) 因为外部压缩方法\n      的 token selection 策略不如 ACIS 精确——它们不直接优化 margin，只是受益于 IMM 训练\n      使 importance landscape 更 separable。但改善方向一致，confirming denoising effect\n      不依赖于 ACIS 的具体实现。\n    tables:\n      - name: \"Table 7: Cross-Compression Compatibility\"\n        columns: [\"Method\", \"Loss (base)\", \"Loss (+IMM)\", \"Pres. (base)\", \"Pres. (+IMM)\", \"Δ Pres. pp\"]\n        rows:\n          - [\"FastV\", 0.0058, 0.0048, \"41%\", \"89%\", \"+48\"]\n          - [\"VLA-IAP\", 0.0052, 0.0044, \"38%\", \"90%\", \"+52\"]\n          - [\"VLA-Cache\", 0.0063, 0.0051, \"35%\", \"87%\", \"+52\"]\n          - [\"ACIS (ours)\", 0.0041, 0.0035, \"34%*\", \"92%\", \"+58\"]\n    figures_description:\n      - \"Grouped bar chart: 4 compression methods × 2 conditions (base vs +IMM)，dual y-axis for loss 和 preservation\"\n    analysis: >\n      IMM 在三种外部压缩方法上均带来 ~50pp preservation 提升和 ~17% loss 改善。\n      证明 IMM 是 compression-agnostic training framework，不依赖 ACIS 作为唯一 compression mechanism。\n      这直接回应 RC6 并扩大了 contribution scope。\n\n  - name: \"Defense Comparison (IMM vs AT vs Smoothing vs Jacobian)\"\n    plan_id: \"plan_007\"\n    description: >\n      IMM vs adversarial training vs randomized smoothing vs RobustVLA Jacobian regularization,\n      在 LIBERO-Plus 7 维扰动下对比 success rate。\n    expected_results:\n      imm_clean_sr: 0.76\n      imm_perturbed_sr: 0.71\n      imm_sr_drop_pp: 5\n      adv_training_clean_sr: 0.68\n      adv_training_perturbed_sr: 0.63\n      adv_training_sr_drop_pp: 5\n      rand_smoothing_clean_sr: 0.70\n      rand_smoothing_perturbed_sr: 0.61\n      rand_smoothing_sr_drop_pp: 9\n      jacobian_reg_clean_sr: 0.72\n      jacobian_reg_perturbed_sr: 0.65\n      jacobian_reg_sr_drop_pp: 7\n      no_defense_clean_sr: 0.71\n      no_defense_perturbed_sr: 0.48\n      no_defense_sr_drop_pp: 23\n    result_rationale: >\n      IMM 的独特优势：clean performance 不降反升（denoising effect），同时 robustness 最强。\n      \n      Adversarial training：clean SR 降 3pp（AT 的经典 accuracy-robustness tradeoff），\n      perturbed SR 改善但不及 IMM，因为 AT 只在 training distribution 的 adversarial examples 上\n      鲁棒，对 LIBERO-Plus 的 7 维 out-of-distribution 扰动（lighting, camera, texture 等）\n      泛化有限。Less Is More (2601.12042) 已指出 AT 对 VLA 的 'only limited protection'。\n      \n      Randomized smoothing：引入 inference-time noise 使 prediction 更 smooth，\n      但 VLA 的 action space 对 noise 敏感——smooth prediction ≠ correct prediction，\n      导致 clean SR 和 perturbed SR 双降。\n      \n      Jacobian regularization：限制 output 对 input 的灵敏度，clean SR 轻微下降（-1pp），\n      robustness 中等——Jacobian reg 是 global 的，不区分 important vs unimportant tokens，\n      因此在 preservation 维度不如 IMM 的 margin-specific optimization。\n      \n      IMM 是唯一同时满足 (1) clean SR ≥ baseline 和 (2) perturbed SR drop < 10pp 的方法。\n    tables:\n      - name: \"Table 8: Defense Comparison (LIBERO-Avg, SmolVLA)\"\n        columns: [\"Defense\", \"Clean SR%\", \"Perturbed SR%\", \"Drop (pp)\", \"Training Cost (GPU-h)\"]\n        rows:\n          - [\"No defense\", 71.3, 48, 23.3, 0]\n          - [\"Adversarial Training\", 68, 63, 5, 45]\n          - [\"Randomized Smoothing\", 70, 61, 9, 0]\n          - [\"Jacobian Reg.\", 72, 65, 7, 35]\n          - [\"IMM (ours)\", 76, 71, 5, 30]\n    figures_description:\n      - \"Scatter plot: x=Clean SR, y=Perturbed SR，5 个方法标注，IMM 在 Pareto frontier 右上角\"\n      - \"Radar chart: 7 LIBERO-Plus 扰动维度的 per-dimension SR，IMM 对比其他 defense\"\n    analysis: >\n      IMM 是唯一 Pareto-dominant 的 defense——clean SR 最高且 robustness drop 最小。\n      关键 differentiator：其他 defense 牺牲 clean performance 换取 robustness（经典 tradeoff），\n      而 IMM 的 denoising effect 使两者同方向改善。这是 paper 的 strongest selling point。\n\n  - name: \"Pruning Ratio Sweep\"\n    plan_id: \"plan_008\"\n    description: >\n      k_ratio = 0.3/0.4/0.5/0.6/0.7/0.8/0.9 下 G3 曲线，\n      SmolVLA + aloha_sim_insertion，找最优压缩点。\n    expected_results:\n      ratio_03_G3: 1.18\n      ratio_04_G3: 0.91\n      ratio_05_G3: 0.87\n      ratio_06_G3: 0.84\n      ratio_07_G3: 0.86\n      ratio_08_G3: 0.91\n      ratio_09_G3: 0.97\n      sweet_spot_range: \"0.4-0.6\"\n      optimal_ratio: 0.55\n      optimal_G3: 0.83\n      ratio_03_success_rate: 0.74\n      ratio_05_success_rate: 0.88\n      ratio_06_success_rate: 0.90\n      ratio_07_success_rate: 0.87\n      ratio_09_success_rate: 0.83\n    result_rationale: >\n      Pruning ratio sweep 揭示 U 型曲线，sweet spot 在 0.4-0.6：\n      \n      ratio=0.3（保留 30% token）：过度压缩，开始丢失 task-critical token。\n      即使 ACIS 的 importance ranking 完美，30% 的 token 可能不足以覆盖 action-relevant\n      的 spatial region。G3=1.18 > 1.0 说明 compression harm > denoising benefit。\n      \n      ratio=0.4-0.6：denoising sweet spot。被删除的 token 主要是低 attention weight 的\n      背景 token（桌面纹理、远处物体），移除它们减少了 action head 的 distractor，\n      同时保留了充足的 task-relevant token。G3 在 0.55 处达到最优 0.83。\n      \n      ratio=0.7-0.9：保留过多 token，denoising effect 减弱（noise token 大量保留），\n      G3 趋向 1.0。ratio=0.9 时几乎等同于 no pruning，G3=0.97 反映了微弱的 regularization\n      effect（移除最不 important 的 10% token 仍有轻微降噪作用）。\n      \n      这个 U 型曲线是 denoising claim 的 strongest mechanistic evidence：\n      如果 G3<1.0 是 evaluation artifact，曲线应该是单调递增的（越多 token 越好）。\n      U 型曲线证明存在 optimal pruning point where denoising > information loss。\n    tables:\n      - name: \"Table 9: Pruning Ratio Sweep (SmolVLA, aloha_sim_insertion)\"\n        columns: [\"Keep Ratio\", \"G3 Ratio\", \"Action Loss\", \"Success Rate%\", \"Margin Δ_k\"]\n        rows:\n          - [0.3, 1.18, 0.00479, 74, 1.21]\n          - [0.4, 0.91, 0.00370, 85, 1.05]\n          - [0.5, 0.87, 0.00354, 88, 0.93]\n          - [0.55, 0.83, 0.00338, 90, 0.88]\n          - [0.6, 0.84, 0.00342, 90, 0.82]\n          - [0.7, 0.86, 0.00350, 87, 0.71]\n          - [0.8, 0.91, 0.00370, 85, 0.58]\n          - [0.9, 0.97, 0.00394, 83, 0.42]\n    figures_description:\n      - \"Dual-axis plot: x=keep ratio, left-y=G3 ratio (U 型), right-y=success rate (inverted U)，shaded sweet spot 0.4-0.6\"\n      - \"Stacked area: 保留/删除 token 中 high-attention (>median) 比例随 keep ratio 变化\"\n    analysis: >\n      U 型 G3 曲线确认 denoising mechanism：存在 optimal pruning point (0.4-0.6) \n      where 移除的 token 主要是 noise。Sweet spot 的稳定性（0.4-0.6 区间 G3 全 <0.92）\n      说明该现象不是 threshold effect 而是 robust regime。\n      这是 Claim 3 的核心 figure，直接回应 RC1。\n\n  - name: \"Token Importance Mechanistic Analysis\"\n    plan_id: \"plan_009\"\n    description: >\n      分析被 ACIS 删除 vs 保留 token 的 attention weight 分布、\n      与 action prediction 的 gradient magnitude 相关性。\n    expected_results:\n      pruned_token_avg_attn_weight: 0.0018\n      retained_token_avg_attn_weight: 0.0073\n      attn_weight_ratio: 0.247\n      p_value_attn_diff: 0.00001\n      pruned_token_avg_grad_magnitude: 0.00012\n      retained_token_avg_grad_magnitude: 0.00089\n      grad_ratio: 0.135\n      p_value_grad_diff: 0.00001\n      importance_action_correlation: 0.72\n      spatial_analysis_pruned_frac_background: 0.83\n      spatial_analysis_pruned_frac_object: 0.08\n      spatial_analysis_pruned_frac_gripper: 0.04\n    result_rationale: >\n      Attention weight ratio 0.247 (在 best-tier [0.1, 0.4] 范围内) 表明被 pruned 的 token\n      收到的 attention 只有保留 token 的 ~25%。这直接说明 ACIS 学到的 importance scoring\n      与 backbone 的 internal attention allocation 高度一致——被 ACIS 标记为 unimportant 的 token\n      本来就不被 backbone 关注。\n      \n      Gradient magnitude ratio 0.135 更极端——pruned token 对 action loss 的梯度贡献\n      只有保留 token 的 13.5%。这意味着即使保留这些 token，它们对 action prediction\n      的影响也极小。移除它们近乎无损，而减少了 attention computation 中的 noise 传播\n      （low-importance token 仍然参与 attention softmax 并稀释 important token 的 weight）。\n      \n      空间分析显示 83% 的被 pruned token 来自背景区域（通过与 segmentation mask 对比），\n      只有 4% 来自 gripper 区域和 8% 来自目标物体区域。这提供了 intuitive 的 mechanistic\n      explanation：ACIS denoising = 自动背景移除。\n      \n      p < 0.01 的显著性来源于 500 batch × 256 token/batch 的大样本量（128000 个 token 对比）。\n    tables:\n      - name: \"Table 10: Token Importance Mechanistic Analysis\"\n        columns: [\"Metric\", \"Pruned Tokens\", \"Retained Tokens\", \"Ratio\", \"p-value\"]\n        rows:\n          - [\"Avg Attention Weight\", 0.0018, 0.0073, 0.247, \"<0.001\"]\n          - [\"Avg Gradient Magnitude\", 0.00012, 0.00089, 0.135, \"<0.001\"]\n          - [\"Action Loss Contribution\", \"3.2%\", \"96.8%\", 0.033, \"<0.001\"]\n      - name: \"Table 11: Spatial Distribution of Pruned Tokens\"\n        columns: [\"Region\", \"% of Pruned Tokens\", \"% of Retained Tokens\"]\n        rows:\n          - [\"Background\", \"83%\", \"34%\"]\n          - [\"Table surface\", \"5%\", \"12%\"]\n          - [\"Target object\", \"8%\", \"38%\"]\n          - [\"Gripper\", \"4%\", \"16%\"]\n    figures_description:\n      - \"Violin plot: attention weight distribution for pruned vs retained tokens (two violins, pruned 明显左偏)\"\n      - \"Heatmap overlay: 原始图像上 token importance 的 spatial map，pruned tokens 标红，retained 标绿\"\n      - \"Scatter: per-token ACIS importance score (x) vs attention weight (y), r=0.72\"\n    analysis: >\n      Mechanistic evidence 三位一体：(1) attention weight 差异 (p<0.001)，(2) gradient 差异 (p<0.001)，\n      (3) 空间分布对应背景移除。Denoising claim 从 'empirical observation' 升级为 \n      'mechanistic finding with statistical and spatial support'。\n      审稿人无法将此归因为 evaluation artifact。\n\n  - name: \"Mask Ratio Annealing Ablation (v8c)\"\n    plan_id: \"plan_010\"\n    description: >\n      mask ratio annealing (0.9→0.5) vs two-stage 固定 0.5 对比，\n      验证 curriculum-style pruning 是否优于固定比例。\n    expected_results:\n      v8c_annealing_action_loss: 0.00362\n      v8c_annealing_G3_deploy: 0.89\n      v8c_annealing_G1_margin: 88.7\n      v8b_fixed_action_loss: 0.00354\n      v8b_fixed_G3_deploy: 0.87\n      v8b_fixed_G1_margin: 93.2\n      annealing_advantage: \"marginal, not significant\"\n    result_rationale: >\n      Annealing 的假设是 curriculum-style training（先 prune 少量 → 逐渐增加）让 ACIS\n      从 easy case 学起。实际上 two-stage 已经解决了 co-adaptation——ACIS 在 frozen backbone\n      上独立训练时，importance landscape 已经 well-separated，不需要 curriculum。\n      \n      V8c 的 G3=0.89 略逊于 v8b 的 0.87，可能因为 annealing 的前期高 keep-ratio (0.9)\n      阶段浪费了 training budget 在近乎 trivial 的 ranking task 上（只 prune 10% 时几乎\n      任何 scoring function 都行），导致 ACIS 在后期 0.5 ratio 上的训练不足。\n      G1 margin 88.7 vs 93.2 也轻微落后。\n      \n      结论：annealing 不是必要的。Two-stage 的简洁性（固定 0.5）既是优点也是结果最优。\n      这简化了 method presentation——不需要额外的 annealing schedule 超参数。\n    tables:\n      - name: \"Table 12: Annealing vs Fixed Ratio\"\n        columns: [\"Strategy\", \"Action Loss\", \"G3 Ratio\", \"G1 Margin\", \"Extra Hyperparam\"]\n        rows:\n          - [\"Two-Stage Fixed 0.5 (v8b)\", 0.00354, 0.87, \"93.2x\", \"None\"]\n          - [\"Annealing 0.9→0.5 (v8c)\", 0.00362, 0.89, \"88.7x\", \"Annealing schedule\"]\n    figures_description:\n      - \"Training curve overlay: v8b vs v8c action loss over steps，两者收敛到相近水平\"\n    analysis: >\n      Annealing 没有带来显著收益，反而增加了一个 hyperparameter。\n      Two-stage fixed ratio 是 Pareto-optimal 的选择。\n      Paper 中作为 negative result 简单提及即可，无需展开。\n\n  - name: \"ACIS Overhead Quantification\"\n    plan_id: \"plan_011\"\n    description: >\n      ACIS 模块的参数量、FLOPs、推理延迟测量。\n      证明 ACIS 的 deployment cost 可忽略。\n    expected_results:\n      acis_params_M: 2.3\n      backbone_params_M: 256\n      acis_param_overhead_pct: 0.9\n      acis_flops_per_token_M: 0.18\n      backbone_flops_per_token_M: 12.5\n      acis_flop_overhead_pct: 1.4\n      inference_latency_baseline_ms: 45.2\n      inference_latency_with_acis_ms: 46.1\n      inference_latency_with_acis_prune_ms: 28.7\n      latency_overhead_ms: 0.9\n      net_latency_saving_pct: 36.5\n      memory_saving_with_prune_pct: 42\n    result_rationale: >\n      ACIS 是 lightweight cross-attention module：2-layer MLP + single cross-attention head。\n      参数量 ~2.3M 对比 SmolVLA backbone 256M 只有 0.9% overhead。\n      \n      FLOPs 更低（1.4%）因为 ACIS 只做一次 forward pass per image（scoring all tokens），\n      而 backbone 对每个 token 做多层 transformer 计算。\n      \n      关键卖点：ACIS 引入 0.9ms 延迟但 50% token pruning 节省 16.5ms（256→128 token\n      减少后续 transformer 层的 O(n²) attention 计算），net saving 36.5%。\n      \n      Memory 节省 42%（不完全是 50% 因为 ACIS 本身占用少量 memory + 非 token 参数不变）。\n      \n      这将 RC4 的 concern 彻底翻转：ACIS 不是 overhead，是 deployment accelerator。\n    tables:\n      - name: \"Table 13: ACIS Deployment Overhead\"\n        columns: [\"Metric\", \"Baseline\", \"With ACIS+Prune\", \"Change\"]\n        rows:\n          - [\"Parameters (M)\", 256, 258.3, \"+0.9%\"]\n          - [\"FLOPs/token (M)\", 12.5, 12.68, \"+1.4%\"]\n          - [\"Inference Latency (ms)\", 45.2, 28.7, \"-36.5%\"]\n          - [\"GPU Memory (MB)\", 1840, 1068, \"-42%\"]\n    figures_description:\n      - \"Stacked bar: inference time breakdown (ACIS scoring + backbone forward)，showing net speedup\"\n    analysis: >\n      ACIS 是 net positive for deployment：0.9% param overhead 换来 36.5% latency reduction 和\n      42% memory saving。类比 BatchNorm——微小 overhead 但不可或缺的 training component。\n      RC4 完全化解。\n\n  - name: \"LIBERO-Plus Full Robustness Evaluation\"\n    plan_id: \"plan_012\"\n    description: >\n      IMM+compression (SmolVLA) 在 LIBERO-Plus 7 维扰动\n      (lighting, camera_pose, texture, distractor, background, physics, combined)\n      上的 success rate 全面评估。\n    expected_results:\n      clean_sr: 0.76\n      lighting_sr: 0.73\n      camera_pose_sr: 0.70\n      texture_sr: 0.74\n      distractor_sr: 0.72\n      background_sr: 0.75\n      physics_sr: 0.68\n      combined_sr: 0.62\n      avg_perturbed_sr: 0.706\n      avg_sr_drop_pp: 5.4\n      no_defense_clean_sr: 0.713\n      no_defense_combined_sr: 0.35\n      no_defense_avg_perturbed_sr: 0.48\n      relative_improvement_combined_pp: 27\n    result_rationale: >\n      LIBERO-Plus 的 7 维扰动测试不同 failure mode：\n      \n      Lighting/background/texture 是视觉 domain shift——IMM 最强的防线。ACIS 的 importance\n      scoring 基于 semantic relevance 而非 visual appearance，所以光照/纹理变化影响\n      appearance 但不影响 importance ranking。SR drop 仅 1-3pp。\n      \n      Camera pose：中等影响（SR drop 6pp）。视角变化改变了 token 的空间含义——\n      原本的背景 token 可能变成 object token，ACIS 的 importance scoring 需要一定\n      generalization。IMM 训练提供了 margin buffer 使小幅视角变化仍保持 top-k 稳定。\n      \n      Distractor：引入新物体干扰 action prediction。IMM 的 denoising 效果在这里最直接——\n      distractor 物体对应的 token 被 ACIS 标为低重要性并 pruned，相当于自动滤除干扰。\n      SR drop 4pp。\n      \n      Physics：最难（SR drop 8pp）因为 physics 扰动改变了 action dynamics 而非视觉输入，\n      IMM 的 token-level 保护对此帮助有限。但 50% 压缩减少了 action head 的 input noise，\n      仍然优于 no-defense。\n      \n      Combined：所有 7 维同时扰动。SR drop 14pp 显著但仍有 62%（vs no-defense 35%），\n      改善 27pp。这是 headline number。\n    tables:\n      - name: \"Table 14: LIBERO-Plus 7-Dim Robustness (SmolVLA, LIBERO-Avg)\"\n        columns: [\"Perturbation\", \"IMM SR%\", \"No Defense SR%\", \"IMM Δpp\", \"No Def. Δpp\"]\n        rows:\n          - [\"Clean\", 76, 71.3, \"—\", \"—\"]\n          - [\"Lighting\", 73, 58, -3, -13]\n          - [\"Camera Pose\", 70, 52, -6, -19]\n          - [\"Texture\", 74, 60, -2, -11]\n          - [\"Distractor\", 72, 55, -4, -16]\n          - [\"Background\", 75, 62, -1, -9]\n          - [\"Physics\", 68, 46, -8, -25]\n          - [\"Combined (all 7)\", 62, 35, -14, -36]\n    figures_description:\n      - \"Radar chart: 7 perturbation dimensions, IMM (outer) vs No Defense (inner), 清晰展示 IMM 在所有维度上的优势\"\n      - \"Bar chart: per-dimension SR drop (pp), IMM vs No Defense，IMM 的 bar 全部更短\"\n    analysis: >\n      IMM 在所有 7 个扰动维度上均优于 no-defense，combined 场景从 35% 提升到 62%。\n      Headline result: \"SmolVLA with IMM achieves 76% clean / 62% combined-perturbed success rate \n      under 50% token compression on LIBERO, while undefended compression retains only 71.3% / 35%.\"\n      这是 paper abstract 的核心数字。\n```","stop_reason":"end_turn","session_id":"69face55-f680-40e2-aea1-97304e995fd8","total_cost_usd":0.437729,"usage":{"input_tokens":2,"cache_creation_input_tokens":12510,"cache_read_input_tokens":11841,"output_tokens":13841,"server_tool_use":{"web_search_requests":0,"web_fetch_requests":0},"service_tier":"standard","cache_creation":{"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":12510,"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0},"inference_geo":"","iterations":[{"input_tokens":2,"output_tokens":13841,"cache_read_input_tokens":11841,"cache_creation_input_tokens":12510,"cache_creation":{"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0,"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":12510},"type":"message"}],"speed":"standard"},"modelUsage":{"claude-haiku-4-5-20251001":{"inputTokens":7461,"outputTokens":25,"cacheReadInputTokens":0,"cacheCreationInputTokens":0,"webSearchRequests":0,"costUSD":0.007586,"contextWindow":200000,"maxOutputTokens":32000},"claude-opus-4-6":{"inputTokens":2,"outputTokens":13841,"cacheReadInputTokens":11841,"cacheCreationInputTokens":12510,"webSearchRequests":0,"cost